      "text": "ECONOMIC LOGIC:\n    The tier structure is not just about price — it's about\n    the function of fashion within each brand's P&L.\n    Haute couture is advertising for the fragrance business.\n    The Birkin bag waitlist is a customer acquisition funnel\n    for the $300 Hermès silk scarf.\n```"
    },
