      "text": "```\n  LEGAL DEFINITION (France):\n    Chambre Syndicale de la Haute Couture (founded 1868)\n    Membership criteria (Chambre Syndicale / FHCM):\n    → Garments made-to-order for private clients\n    → At least 15 full-time employees in Parisian atelier\n    → Present 2 collections per year (SS + AW)\n       of at least 50 designs each\n    → Must include both day and evening wear"
    },
