      "text": "CURRENT OFFICIAL MEMBERS: ~15 (varies year to year)\n    Chanel, Dior, Givenchy, Valentino, Jean Paul Gaultier,\n    Schiaparelli, Elie Saab, Viktor & Rolf,\n    Iris van Herpen, Alexis Mabille (among others)\n    \"Guest members\": Armani, others on invitation basis"
