      "text": "THE ATELIER SYSTEM:\n    Première (head seamstress): leads the workroom\n    Petite main: senior seamstress; executes complex work\n    Flou atelier: soft, draped garments (dresses, gowns)\n    Tailleur atelier: tailored garments (suits, structured)\n    Broderie (Lesage): embroidery house\n    Plumassier (Lemarié): feathers and flowers\n    Bottier (Massaro): shoes\n    Many \"petites mains\" ateliers are independent specialist\n    houses contracted by multiple couture houses\n```"
    },
