      },
      "text": "PAUL POIRET (1879-1944):\n    \"King of fashion\" before WWI\n    Liberated women from the corset (dramatic shift, 1906-1910)\n    Introduced harem pants, hobble skirt, kimono jacket\n    Theatrical fashion presentations; influenced by Orientalism\n    First to license his name commercially\n    First to create brand-connected fragrance (Rosine, 1911)\n    Financial collapse during WWI; never recovered"
    },
    {
