      },
      "text": "COCO CHANEL (1883-1971):\n    Jersey fabric for women's daywear — revolutionary (1913)\n    The \"little black dress\" (1926) — democratized elegance\n    Chanel No. 5 (1921) — abstracted floral + aldehydes;\n      first modern designer fragrance; still world's bestseller\n    Removed corset, shortened skirts, adopted male motifs\n    Came out of retirement 1954 to compete with Dior's New Look"
    },
    {
