      "text": "CHRISTIAN DIOR: \"NEW LOOK\" (1947):\n    Post-war return to femininity: full skirts, tiny waist,\n    soft shoulders — the opposite of wartime utility\n    Controversy: women's groups protested (fabric luxury;\n    liberation rollback); others embraced escape from rationing\n    Defined 1950s silhouette globally\n    Dior house today: €6.7B revenue (2022)"
    },
