      },
      "text": "YVES SAINT LAURENT (1936-2008):\n    \"Le Smoking\" (1966): tuxedo suit for women\n    Mondrian dress (1965): color-block Mondrian painting as clothing\n    Pop art prints, African/Moroccan cultural references\n    Ready-to-wear line (Rive Gauche, 1966): brought designer to masses\n    Said: \"Chanel freed the body; I armed it\""
    },
    {
