      "text": "REI KAWAKUBO / COMME DES GARÇONS (founded 1969, Tokyo):\n    Deconstruction, asymmetry, raw edges, \"poverty aesthetic\"\n    Paris debut 1981: called \"anti-fashion\" and \"Hiroshima chic\"\n    by French press — response to Western beauty norms\n    Never interviews; work is the statement\n    Dover Street Market concept stores as retail philosophy"
    },
