      "text": "VIRGIL ABLOH (1980-2021):\n    Streetwear + luxury convergence\n    Off-White brand (2013): quotation marks on clothes,\n    industrial belt buckles — citing/commenting on fashion\n    Louis Vuitton Men's Artistic Director (2018) —\n    first Black American artistic director of a major French house\n    Trained as architect (IIT); brought structural thinking to fashion\n```"
