      "text": "```\n  TRADITIONAL MODEL (two seasons):\n    Spring/Summer (SS): February shows; hits stores June\n    Autumn/Winter (AW): September shows; hits stores December/January\n    Six-month lead time from design to store"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-FASHION-INDUSTRY.md#025",
      "path": [
        "13-FASHION-INDUSTRY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
