        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Fashion Industry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MODERN CALENDAR EXPANSION:\n    Pre-Fall (Resort): November-January; between main seasons\n    Resort/Cruise: May-June; show at travel-relevant venues\n    Men's: separate fashion week (January London/Florence/Paris;\n           June Milan/Paris)\n    Result: 4-6 collections per year from major houses"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-FASHION-INDUSTRY.md#026",
      "path": [
        "13-FASHION-INDUSTRY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:textiles:13-fashion-industry, git-history:textiles:13-fashion-industry]",
