        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Fashion Industry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "FASHION WEEKS (\"The Big Four\"):\n    New York → London → Milan → Paris\n    Order matters: NY/London = more commercial; Milan/Paris = more artistic\n    Show order: emerging brands → established houses → final shows\n    Shows are NOT primarily for public: buyers, press, editors\n    Retail orders placed at showrooms (appointment-based)\n    The show = brand image; the showroom = actual commerce"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-FASHION-INDUSTRY.md#027",
      "path": [
        "13-FASHION-INDUSTRY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
