        "title": "Fashion Industry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SOCIAL MEDIA DISRUPTION:\n    Pre-Instagram: fashion absorbed into public 6 months after show\n    Post-Instagram: show images globally available in minutes\n    → \"Outdated\" before stores carry it\n    → Response: \"see now, buy now\" (Burberry 2016, briefly)\n    → TikTok microtrends: \"ballet core\" \"quiet luxury\" live days\n    → Traditional 6-month lead impossible for microtrend response\n    → Only Zara/Shein speed can respond\n```"
    },
