      "text": "```\n  ZARA MODEL (Inditex, founded Amancio Ortega, 1975, La Coruña, Spain):"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-FASHION-INDUSTRY.md#031",
      "path": [
        "13-FASHION-INDUSTRY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
