      "text": "VERTICAL INTEGRATION:\n      Own factories in Spain, Portugal, Morocco for speed\n      (not cheapest but fastest — 2-week concept to store)\n      Asian sourcing for basic/commodity items (longer lead)\n      Own logistics, own trucking to European distribution"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-FASHION-INDUSTRY.md#032",
      "path": [
        "13-FASHION-INDUSTRY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
