      },
      "text": "THE FEEDBACK LOOP:\n      Store staff report weekly what's selling/not selling\n      → Design adjusts in real time\n      → Small initial orders → rapid reorder if selling\n      → Never over-committed to trend that dies\n      Result: 80%+ full-price sell-through (industry: ~60%)\n      Low markdown rate = higher margin despite lower prices"
    },
    {
      "id": "13-FASHION-INDUSTRY.md#033",
      "path": [
        "13-FASHION-INDUSTRY.md"
      ],
