        "title": "Fashion Industry",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "LEAD TIME: 2-3 weeks (Europe) vs 6 months (traditional)\n    COLLECTIONS: ~20+ \"drops\" per year vs traditional 2-4"
    },
