      "text": "H&M MODEL:\n    Longer lead times (6-8 months for Asia production)\n    Lower prices, higher volume than Zara\n    Guest designer collaborations (Lagerfeld 2004, Balmain, Versace)\n    More markdowns; higher inventory risk\n    Struggling with overstock and ESG pressure"
